---
description: Dutch full female name - one given name and one surname (Jan de Vries). A Dutch name carries a single surname. Where the surname begins with a tussenvoegsel the particle stays lowercase after the given name, which is exactly the form person/lastName.txt stores, so this template needs no special casing.
generator: tdc
locale: nl
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="nl.person.female.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="nl.person.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
